From 1095dd0807042cb0db61e94e8aca23d40fd14395 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hades <15710513+hadesdevls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 08:55:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tools/dvbridge: the pass of the pairs fails closed on its own

The pass that converts the pixels drawn over a profile 5 picture once a pair, and the transport
that takes its codes, were in the program of the transport that every profile takes: had a GPU's
compiler refused the new input (an unsigned sampler of the codes), the packer of the source
transport would not have been made at all, and every Dolby Vision picture, of every profile, would
have gone out in the converted transport. They were tested on lavapipe and, through D3D12, on an
integrated Radeon and an RTX 4080 SUPER; not with radeonsi nor with the GLSL compiler of NVIDIA's
driver that the image runs.

The transport is again the program it was before the pass (PACK, the same text as before it, the
GLSL of the conversion included), and every frame takes it but those whose pixels drawn over the
pass converted. Those take a program of their own (PACK_PAIRS, the transport of the pass as it
was), made with the pass after the rest of the packer and only with it: where either does not
compile or link, both are left out, the packer is made as before the pass, and it says so once on
standard error. Kodi's log says it once in a stream that would have taken the pass, from a note of
the renderer (dvbridge_source_pairs_missed(), pairs_missed of dvbridge_render_notes).

Checked with the host test of the bridge (162 frames of profile 5, 7 FEL and 8.1 pictures with
Kodi's GUI composited over them): the GLSL of the transport is that of the commit before the pass,
and those of the pass and of its transport are those of the pass; the same bytes as before on
lavapipe and, through D3D12, on the integrated Radeon and the RTX 4080 SUPER, also with a syntax
error forced into either new program, where the packer is made, the source transport is taken,
and the note is raised for each of the 81 frames of profile 5, all packed with what Kodi drew over
them (an empty GUI included), and for none without the error; the seven mutations of the pass
still make the bytes differ.
